# Fumadocs site

- Prefer **Fumadocs** layouts/components (`fumadocs-ui`, `fumadocs-core`) over custom docs chrome
- MDX components: extend via `components/mdx.tsx`; keep default Fumadocs MDX as base
- Docs source: `lib/source.ts` → `content/docs`; learn: `lib/learn.ts` → `content/learn`
- Preserve AL highlighting in `source.config.ts` / `lib/al-language.ts` (`langAlias.businesscentral` → `al`)
- Before App Router / Next API changes, read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`
- Use `pnpm`; verify with `pnpm lint` and `pnpm build` after site changes
